          "duration": 6,
          "type": "explanation",
          "text": "Never: more faster. Never: more bigger.",
          "voice_line": "And one more thing. Never double up. Never say more faster or more bigger. That is called a double comparative and it is always <break time=\"0.3s\"/> Wrong. Faster. Bigger. One method only.",
          "tone": "serious",
          "stickman_action": "x_arms_no",
          "stickman_emotion": "serious",
          "visual": {
